From efaaf9e9ca4b1d52731a3cd236a231d14e922983 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aiaimimi0920 <153103332+aiaimimi0920@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 01:29:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] GDScript: expose editor analysis helper

Port the personal validation, function-outline, completion, and symbol-lookup wrapper to the modern EditorLanguage API while retaining headless editor-build use.

Godot-Patch-Topic: scripting.gdscript-helper
---
